{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the New World of Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome, Testers!</strong><br>Step into <i>Physics World: Evolution,</i>\u00a0the next-generation sandbox simulation where physics is your playground and curiosity is your guide. As the spiritual successor to 2023\u2019s <i>Physics Lab</i>, this evolution delivers more tools, more locations, and a world layered with secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Tools. New Chaos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the limits of what\u2019s possible using an expanded arsenal of physics tools and environmental objects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch <strong>explosives</strong>\u00a0or\u00a0<strong>detonate nukes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter <strong>jars</strong>, <strong>rocks</strong>, and more with real-time physics interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment freely across <strong>5+ diverse testing labs</strong>, each with unique environments and potential outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're stacking, smashing, or sending objects into orbit, your creativity is the only limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover a Hidden Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the tests lies a deeper mystery\u2026<br>What happened to the world before you arrived?<br>Scattered across the locations are <strong>hidden articles</strong>\u00a0and <strong>clues</strong> that hint at a story far bigger than any single experiment. Piece together the past and uncover the truth buried beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3383470?t=1761666370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383470/2c39a0903dff77131d749277bb5919a26b5d4e17/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761666370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383470/7caae6170455e7a45277be3b4b82d4600da614c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761666370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383470/7caae6170455e7a45277be3b4b82d4600da614c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761666370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the New World of Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome, Testers!</strong><br>Step into <i>Physics World: Evolution,</i>\u00a0the next-generation sandbox simulation where physics is your playground and curiosity is your guide. As the spiritual successor to 2023\u2019s <i>Physics Lab</i>, this evolution delivers more tools, more locations, and a world layered with secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Tools. New Chaos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the limits of what\u2019s possible using an expanded arsenal of physics tools and environmental objects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch <strong>explosives</strong>\u00a0or\u00a0<strong>detonate nukes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter <strong>jars</strong>, <strong>rocks</strong>, and more with real-time physics interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment freely across <strong>5+ diverse testing labs</strong>, each with unique environments and potential outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're stacking, smashing, or sending objects into orbit, your creativity is the only limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover a Hidden Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the tests lies a deeper mystery\u2026<br>What happened to the world before you arrived?<br>Scattered across the locations are <strong>hidden articles</strong>\u00a0and <strong>clues</strong> that hint at a story far bigger than any single experiment. Piece together the past and uncover the truth buried beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Barlow Games Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383470/0a51f33d57ef3a557b87cb3b4396781fa9891e5a/header.jpg?t=1761666370","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Physics World: Evolution \u00a9 2025 Barlow Games Ltd. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3383470/111315381/abd84a173683e09399fddc65745cd24ebc5dec5d/1760971381/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760972134","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3383470/111315381/abd84a173683e09399fddc65745cd24ebc5dec5d/1760971381/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760972134","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3383470/111315381/abd84a173683e09399fddc65745cd24ebc5dec5d/1760971381/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760972134","id":257220136,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220136/movie480.mp4?t=1760972134","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220136/movie_max.mp4?t=1760972134"},"name":"Physics World: Evolution - Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220136/2c551815579642d7460764b2c1599ff32b954210/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760972134","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220136/movie480.webm?t=1760972134","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220136/movie_max.webm?t=1760972134"}}],"name":"Physics World: Evolution","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or New